<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT RICHMOND 32-12.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT RICHMOND 32-12.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Samoa beat Richmond 32-12</p>
<p>in a rugby union tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Richmond - Tries: Fallon, Mason. Coversion: Mason.</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Fa'Aofa (3), Fanolua, So'oalo.</p>
<p>Coversions: Va'a (2). Penalty: Va@a.</p>
